CivicRelay (formerly Civic Records Desk)

Extracted from CivicResultMaps on 2026-09-10.
Standalone source repository: https://github.com/Camreyn/CivicRelay
Original source: https://github.com/Camreyn/civicresultmaps
The original Apache License, Version 2.0 is retained in LICENSE.

This extraction changes runtime/catalog/map integration and adds standalone
packaging, launch/configuration helpers, tests and documentation. It preserves
the original mail safeguards and does not relicense third-party dependencies.

The public catalog, intake form and workflow map are derived from the reviewed
source checkout. data/snapshot-provenance.json records the source commit and
input/output hashes. The map is an illustrative county-derived navigation asset,
not an official boundary release. Source attribution and caveats remain in the
catalog and provenance; private correspondence is not part of this distribution.
